ultraopen
=========

Not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Anthropic PBC or the opencode maintainers.

This project ports the design of Claude Code's "Workflow" tool and its "ultracode" effort mode to
opencode. Portions of the tool description and the workflow-authoring reference are adapted from
Anthropic's Claude Code, which is copyright Anthropic PBC. They are included here for
interoperability: the wording of the opt-in gate, the pipeline-versus-parallel decision rule and
the pattern catalogue is behaviourally load-bearing — a model reads it and writes different code as
a result — so paraphrasing it would change what the tool does.

Adaptations from the original are limited to what opencode actually does:
  - `Workflow({...})` -> `workflow({...})`, the opencode tool id
  - "the Agent tool" -> "the task tool"
  - the asynchronous task-id contract rewritten as blocking, because opencode exposes no
    background-job route to a plugin

"Claude" and "Claude Code" are trademarks of Anthropic PBC. "opencode" is a trademark of its
respective owners.
